==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlGrid44''' command creates a ControlGrid44 from four connected [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4|ControlPoly4]] edges.

